# apps/web/.env.example — copy to apps/web/.env.local (Vite loads *.local automatically
# and it is gitignored, unlike this file).
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_* var at BUILD time — there is no server to validate this
# against, so unlike the api/worker's .env there is nothing here that can make the app
# "refuse to start". An unset value is a supported, safe default (error-tracking.ts
# treats it as "reporting off").

# Error tracking / APM (Sentry, ADR-025) — OPTIONAL. A browser DSN is a DIFFERENT
# Sentry project from the api/worker's Node one (get one from sentry.io's "React" or
# "Browser JavaScript" platform, not "Node").
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
